{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":204313,"duration_api_ms":286105,"num_turns":16,"result":"","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"7712f41c-9512-47c1-85db-4da66f749d38","total_cost_usd":1.0594160000000001,"usage":{"input_tokens":12,"cache_creation_input_tokens":53746,"cache_read_input_tokens":480536,"output_tokens":3089,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":53746,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":258,"outputTokens":24299,"cacheReadInputTokens":1410450,"cacheCreationInputTokens":114522,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.4059505000000001,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":12,"outputTokens":3089,"cacheReadInputTokens":480536,"cacheCreationInputTokens":53746,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.6534654999999999,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"structured_output":{"outcome":"approved","evidence":["All 23 substrate unit tests pass (cargo test -p tank_core --lib systems::substrate::tests): includes rooted_plants_increase_o2_penetration, root_oxygenation_proportional_to_biomass_with_diminishing_returns, floating_plant_biomass_does_not_increase_penetration, zero_root_biomass_yields_zero_oxygenation_bonus, root_oxygenation_uses_named_parameter, root_oxygenation_dynamic_tracks_biomass_growth_and_decline, root_oxygenation_requires_rootable_substrate_habitats, zero_rol_rate_removes_rooted_oxygenation_effects.","All 5 root_zone_oxygenation integration tests pass: planted_vs_unplanted_diverge_in_penetration_depth (500h), planted_substrate_denitrification_interaction (500h), root_oxygenation_reduces_hourly_denitrification_when_it_shrinks_suboxic_volume, planted_substrate_nitrification_surface_area (500h with nitrifier biomass and nitrate divergence), tracing_exposes_root_oxygenation.","All 12 denitrification tests pass (11 ok, 1 ignored). Prior stage mentioned a compile error in denitrification.rs — it is now resolved.","Full tank_core package test suite passes with zero failures across all unit and integration test binaries.","cargo clippy -p tank_core produces zero warnings.","ROL formula: effective_penetration = base_penetration + root_oxygenation_bonus, where bonus = total_depth × (1 - exp(-(active_root_biomass × rol_rate_cm_per_g) / total_depth)). This is a proper saturating exponential — linear at low biomass, asymptotically bounded by substrate depth.","Only PlantGuild::RootFeedingRosette contributes to active_root_biomass_g (substrate.rs:152 filter). FastStem and other guilds are excluded.","rol_rate_cm_per_g is a named parameter in ProcessParams (process.rs:176-189) with serde default of 0.15 cm/g and configurable via default.toml.","engine.rs:410 calls step_substrate_zones which returns SubstrateOxygenationBreakdown; the returned breakdown is reused for all four tracing metrics and four stage notes — no redundant recomputation of the breakdown.","Inline comment at substrate.rs:356-357 documents the interstitial-area invariant: 'SubstrateSurface area includes footprint top surface; subtract it to get only interstitial grain-matrix area available for root colonization.'","Tracing integration test verifies budget metrics expose substrate.base_o2_penetration_depth_cm, substrate.root_oxygenation_bonus_cm, substrate.root_oxygenation_active_biomass_g, and substrate.o2_penetration_depth_cm separately."],"findings_or_gaps":["Minor: from_parts (engine.rs:132) discards the SubstrateOxygenationBreakdown returned by step_substrate_zones. This is harmless since it's only used for initialization normalization, but it's a minor inconsistency with the new return-value API. Not blocking.","Minor: root_oxygenation_active_biomass_g() (substrate.rs:136) calls compute_habitat_registry() internally on every invocation. Since substrate_oxygenation_breakdown() calls this function, and substrate_root_activity_factor already accepts an external registry, there's an opportunity to thread the registry through to avoid this computation. However, the redundant engine-level call was the amendment target and that is resolved; this internal-to-substrate redundancy is a smaller concern and not blocking.","The prior stage noted an outstanding risk about not running the full workspace test suite. I confirmed the full tank_core package tests pass, but did not run cross-crate workspace tests. The touched code is entirely within tank_core, so this is acceptable."],"follow_up_or_amendments":["No blocking amendments required. All acceptance criteria are satisfied with passing tests and clean clippy."]},"fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"cabf8cb5-acbb-47eb-8b07-efc0c5decf7a"}
